# Progress Tracking

After meaningful implementation work, update:

1. `docs/knowledge/PROGRESS.md` — completed / in-progress / remaining / blockers / debt
2. `docs/knowledge/FEATURE_CHECKLIST.md` — page/section statuses
3. `docs/knowledge/DECISIONS.md` — if an architectural or notable implementation choice was made
4. `docs/knowledge/REUSABLE_INVENTORY.md` — if new reusable components, hooks, utils, or assets were added

Skip updates for trivial typos or pure Q&A with no code changes.
